nk for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Vines\" title=\"Twisting Vines\">Twisting Vines</a> surfaces</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Web_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Web (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Web\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Web_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Web (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Web</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Web_(surface)\" title=\"Web (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Web_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Web_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Web_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Web\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Web_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Web_(surface)\" title=\"Web (surface)\">Web</a> surfaces</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Plant Growth (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Plant Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Plant Growth (Condition)\">Plant Growth</a> from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth\" title=\"Plant Growth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/20px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/30px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/40px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Plant Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/20px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth\" title=\"Plant Growth\">Plant Growth</a> spell</li></ul>\n<p><i>Regarding Infernal Evasion:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The reaction provided by this passive may only be used once per long rest.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Steadfast:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Steadfast doesn't prevent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Deep_Water_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Deep Water (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Deep Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Deep_Water_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Deep Water (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Deep Water</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Deep_Water\" title=\"Deep Water\">Deep Water</a> surfaces.</li>\n<li>While the description of Steadfast specifies the wearer cannot be moved by a <i>foe's</i> spells or actions, this also includes allies.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Helldusk_boots_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Helldusk_boots_dyed.png/509